From f597c3f114972c6105dc90a6b11d1c65459ca932 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ayiejosh <132535860+ayiejosh@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:32:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 303/303] pvr, zink, wsi: drop debug and trace hooks, small
 fixes

- Remove the PVR_DUMP_*, PVR_CSB_*, PVR_*_TRACE, PVR_SUBMIT_MIX and
  PVR_VK_GEOM_ONLY hooks and the unlocked allocation counters.
- Remove the zink, kopper, X11 WSI, DRM WSI and EGL timing traces and the
  ZINK_EXTRA_IMAGES knob.
- Tear down the device caches when the dummy render target fails to init.
- Drop a duplicate forward declaration in pvr_csb.h, fix a nested comment
  in pvr_native/pvr_csb.h, and move five pco doxygen comments back onto
  their functions.
---
